# Sample requests for the Banking Transactions API.
# Open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client) and click
# "Send Request" above each request. Start the server first: demo/run.sh or demo\run.bat
# (with demo data loaded, the account examples below return data immediately).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Task 1: core endpoints
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Create a deposit -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 500,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit"
}

### Create a transfer -> 201 (example from TASKS.md)
# @name createTransfer
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 100.50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "transfer"
}

### Create a withdrawal -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 20,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "withdrawal"
}

### Withdrawal larger than the balance -> 201 with "status": "failed"
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 1000000,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "withdrawal"
}

### List all transactions -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions

### Get the transfer created above by id -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{createTransfer.response.body.id}}

### Get a seeded transaction by id -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/tx-0003

### Unknown transaction id -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/does-not-exist

### Account balance (per currency) -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-12345/balance

### Unknown account -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-00000/balance

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Task 2: validation errors -> 400
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Negative amount and invalid currency (example from TASKS.md)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": -5,
  "currency": "XYZ",
  "type": "transfer"
}

### More than 2 decimal places, bad account format, unknown type
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-678",
  "amount": 10.555,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "refund"
}

### Transfer to the same account
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 10,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "transfer"
}

### Body is not valid JSON
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

this is not json

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Task 3: filtering
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### By account (as sender or receiver)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345

### By type
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?type=transfer

### By date range (both days inclusive)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?from=2024-01-01&to=2024-01-31

### Combined filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345&type=deposit&from=2024-01-01&to=2024-12-31

### Invalid filters -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?accountId=bad&type=refund&from=yesterday

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Task 4: additional features
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### A. Account summary -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-12345/summary

### B. Simple interest: 5% per year for 30 days -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-12345/interest?rate=0.05&days=30

### B. Invalid interest parameters -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-12345/interest?rate=5&days=0

### C. Export all transactions as CSV -> 200 text/csv
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/export?format=csv

### C. Export with filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/export?format=csv&accountId=ACC-12345&from=2024-01-01&to=2024-01-31

### C. Unsupported format -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/export?format=xml

### D. Rate limiting: every response has X-RateLimit-Limit / X-RateLimit-Remaining
### headers. Send more than 100 requests in a minute to get 429 Too Many Requests
### (see demo/sample-requests.sh, which does this automatically).
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?type=deposit

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Error handling
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Unknown route -> 404 JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/unknown

### Wrong method -> 405 JSON
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/transactions
